<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mentorship Session Rescheduled</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .email-container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ffc107;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffc107;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        .reschedule-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .session-details {
            background: #fff8e1;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        }
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 10px 0;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .detail-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
        }
        .detail-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .old-session {
            background: #f8d7da;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;
        }
        .new-session {
            background: #d4edda;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
        }
        .reason-box {
            background: #d1ecf1;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            background: #f8f9ff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="reschedule-icon">🔄</div>
            <h1>Session Rescheduled</h1>
        </div>

        <p>Hello <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,</p>
        
        <p>Your mentorship session has been rescheduled. Please find the updated details below.</p>

        <div class="old-session">
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #721c24;">Previous Session</h4>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Date:</span>
                <span class="detail-value"><%= session.oldDate %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Time:</span>
                <span class="detail-value"><%= session.oldTimeSlot %></span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="new-session">
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #155724;">New Session</h4>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Date:</span>
                <span class="detail-value"><%= session.newDate %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Time:</span>
                <span class="detail-value"><%= session.newTimeSlot %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Category:</span>
                <span class="detail-value"><%= session.category %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Duration:</span>
                <span class="detail-value">60 minutes</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reason-box">
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0c5460;">Reschedule Reason</h4>
            <p><%= session.reason %></p>
        </div>

        <div class="session-details">
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #856404;">Important Notes</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>You'll receive a new meet link 24 hours before your rescheduled session</li>
                <li>Please update your calendar with the new date and time</li>
                <li>If you need to make any changes, please contact us at least 24 hours in advance</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-info">
            <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #7C3AED;">Need Help?</h4>
            <p>If you have any questions or need to make further changes:</p>
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> support@calmchase.com</p>
            <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91-XXXXXXXXXX</p>
        </div>

        <p>We apologize for any inconvenience and look forward to seeing you in your rescheduled session!</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>
        <strong>The CalmChase Team</strong></p>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            <p>&copy; 2025 CalmChase. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
